                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Attachment]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Formula Proposed for Disposing of the Chinese
                        Representation Issue at the Resumed Session of the Eighth General
                        Assembly</hi></head>
                <p>“The General Assembly decides to postpone until the adjournment or the
                    termination of its Eighth Regular Session, whichever is earlier, consideration
                    of all proposals to exclude the Representatives of the Government of the
                    Republic of China and to seat Representatives of the Central People’s Government
                    of the People’s Republic of China.”</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1954-01-07">January 7,
                        1954</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
